#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Khasnadda Aqoonsiga Sirta ah"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Faylka Furaha Khasnadda"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored credentials. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write (the same applies to credential files); the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored credentials must be entered again."
msgstr "Waddo buuxda oo ku aaddan furaha 32-byte ee sirta ka dhiga aqoonsiyada sirta ah ee kaydsan. Adigu iskaa u abuur, meel ka baxsan xididka shabakadda, oo ay akhrin karaan oo kaliya adeegaha shabakadda iyo isticmaalaha poller-ka, galka ay wax ku qori karaan root iyo isticmaalahaas oo kaliya (sidoo kale faylasha aqoonsiga sirta ah); plugin-ku marna ma abuuro mana qoro. La kaydi keydka xogta: la'aantiis, aqoonsiyada sirta ah ee kaydsan waa in mar kale la geliyaa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential File Directory"
msgstr "Galka Faylka Aqoonsiga Sirta ah"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the directory that holds credential files. An account can read its credential from a file only inside it, never the vault key file. Empty, the default, refuses credential files. Cloud Admin chooses the file, so keep only cloud credentials here."
msgstr "Waddo buuxda oo ku aaddan galka haya faylasha aqoonsiga sirta ah. Koontadu waxay aqoonsigeeda sirta ah ka akhrin kartaa fayl ku jira gudihiisa oo kaliya, marna ma aha faylka furaha khasnadda. Haddii uu banaan yahay, oo ah dejinta caadiga ah, wuxuu diidaa faylasha aqoonsiga sirta ah. Maamulaha Cloud ayaa doorta faylka, markaa halkan ku hay aqoonsiyada Cloud oo kaliya."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Ururiyaha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Miisaaniyadda Waqtiga Ururiyaha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new work. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished accounts resume on the next run."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada uu hal socodsiin ururiye ku bixin karo ka hor inta uusan joojin bilaabista shaqo cusub. Ka dhig mid ka hooseeya muddada poller-ka; koontooyinka aan dhammaan waxay dib u bilaabmaan socodsiinta xigta."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Ka saar"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Ilaali Jadwalka Plugin-ka Marka La Saarayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its accounts, encrypted credentials, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Cloud resources are never touched either way."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadeeyo, ka saarista plugin-ku waxay ilaalinaysaa koontooyinkiisa, aqoonsiyada sirta ah ee qarsoon, iyo kaydka ku meel gaarka ah. Ka saar calaamadda si ka saaristu u tirtirto. Khayraadka Cloud marna lama taabto si kasta oo ay tahay."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "Not verified yet."
msgstr "Weli lama hubin."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works and has the permissions this account needs."
msgstr "Aqoonsiga sirta ahi wuu shaqeeyaa wuxuuna leeyahay ogolaanshaha koontadani u baahan tahay."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider rejected the credential. It may be wrong, expired, or revoked."
msgstr "Bixiyuhu wuu diiday aqoonsiga sirta ah. Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu khaldan yahay, dhacay, ama la noqday."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works but lacks a permission this account needs."
msgstr "Aqoonsiga sirta ahi wuu shaqeeyaa laakiin waxaa ka maqan ogolaansho ay koontadani u baahan tahay."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider could not be reached. Check the network path and outbound policy from the poller."
msgstr "Bixiyaha lama gaari karin. Hubi waddada shabakadda iyo siyaasadda bixidda ee ka timaadda poller-ka."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider is throttling requests. Try again later."
msgstr "Bixiyuhu wuxuu xaddidayaa codsiyada. Mar dambe isku day."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider sent a response the plugin could not read."
msgstr "Bixiyuhu wuxuu soo diray jawaab uusan plugin-ku akhrin karin."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The account or its credential is not configured correctly."
msgstr "Koontada ama aqoonsigeeda sirta ah si sax ah looma dejin."

